                "text": "I started my day at the Illinois Cancer Care facility in Peoria, visiting with staff and touring the facility. Illinois Cancer Care serves over 20,000 patients each year and I am grateful for their important work to care for individuals with cancer. https://t.co/PccLvJtmrS",
