                "text": "I visited @OSFHealthCare this morning for a hard hat tour of the Cancer Institute in Peoria. The new Cancer Institute will make OSF in Peoria a hub for cancer research & treatment, supporting patients from across the state & country. Thank you to State Rep. Ryan Spain, former Peoria Mayor Jim Ardis, and Ryan Luginbuhl for hosting us. I appreciate OSF\u2019s hard work to serve the community and #BringHopeHome.",
