                "source": "Twitter for iPhone",
                "text": "It was great to start the weekend off joining over 750 fellow Peorians supporting and participating in the 2024 Walk to End Alzheimer\u2019s! \n\nI\u2019ve been proud to introduce legislation such as the Comprehensive Care for Alzheimer\u2019s Act and the CHANGE Act to help support patients, families and caregivers dealing with Alzheimer\u2019s. \n\nThanks to the Alzheimer\u2019s Association and all the volunteers for putting on another outstanding event this year!",
